{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "f90647ecca39a94bd562795387c2a0f1c9a9d5016c8ac30cb43f523368dc0d3b", "ja": "もっと知りたい、あなたのこと", "zh": "想更了解你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bc3ecf2f77f9ba1dd21738d2130490123466d608e63e5a268f61591a6aff5827", "ja": "ドラマの撮影がスタート。風花が出演者達と\n仲を深めようとするが、貴音はどこか線引を\nしている様子。プロデューサーに相談し、\n強引だったかもと気にする風花。だが、貴音\nにも打ち明けにくい事情があると伝える。", "zh": "电视剧的拍摄开始了。风花想和其他演员\n加深感情，但贵音似乎总和大家保持着某种界限。\n风花找制作人商量，担心自己可能太过强硬。\n然而，制作人告诉她，贵音也有难以启齿的隐情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "30b419c61f13b0753a3bfbf39180359b4b22e09304aa3e43cc73ba413c3a0955", "ja": "―『秘密のメモリーズ』撮影初日―", "zh": "——《秘密的Memories》拍摄第一天——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "20d30748d0d7985f303337285265f455308148fff943f7c9baba73a6d52ee19b", "ja": "貴音ちゃん、お疲れさま！\n今日は別々の撮影だったね。どうだった？", "zh": "贵音，辛苦啦！今天我们是分开拍摄的呢。感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "a4b3e316e4d819767032331f364340844ce56ee48c9c4fbb84412a705ffd2006", "ja": "はい、つつがなく演じられたかと。\n……風花も、その様子では順調そうですね。", "zh": "是的，我想应该顺利完成了拍摄。\n……风花看起来也进展得很顺利呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e15c9751e9ffcf8944b2c9c2b053ce434e2694de1b10a27f1160076c8d796697", "ja": "うん、俳優の方たちに教わったりして、なんとか。\nやっぱり専門の方のお話は勉強になるなぁって。", "zh": "嗯，向演员们请教了一些，总算是顺利完成了。\n果然，听专业人士讲解真的很有收获呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "871676a609a0915b4460e0590e815b41122859a04da1f01e2f0b214a317a316b", "ja": "さすがですね。私も見習わなくては……。それで、\n風花はこの後、劇場に戻るのですか？　でしたら……", "zh": "不愧是您。我也必须向您学习才行……那么，风花接下来要回剧场吗？如果是的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e71b79b166ca6533edf85ffe787a68be793ea01f824e93ddb42f73d45e49a37b", "ja": "あ、そのことなんだけど。\n貴音ちゃんはこの後、スケジュール空いてる？", "zh": "啊，说到这个。\n贵音，接下来有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0b60f372f9da56be60ed32c30f00927ef918f021f944d8e00b1829a8f38ff090", "ja": "じつはね、演者のみんなで飲みに行こうって\n話になって。よかったら一緒にどうかなって。", "zh": "其实呢，演出人员们商量着要一起去喝点东西。  \n如果你不介意的话，要不要一起来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "845421a6b8edd5176d1879fe407b30011754d44f30044aa4980caf7663934c07", "ja": "飲みに？　もしや、お酒ですか？", "zh": "去喝酒？莫非，是酒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "af7b05c8e0d1ebc4efe270104124f4e049b7b3f6280bb01799b42475696f374e", "ja": "あ、もちろんソフトドリンクもあるから大丈夫だよ。\nお料理もね、とってもおいしいみたい！", "zh": "啊，当然也有软饮料，所以不用担心哦。\n听说料理也特别好吃呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "62d4271a0bd88fa927a212f778d2d9894553280ecca189cfaff770bedabdf972", "ja": "なんと……それは、心惹かれる誘いですね。\nお声がけありがとうございます。", "zh": "没想到……真是令人心动的邀请。\n谢谢您的邀请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "dfbd657e3f7e44fb50968b5781717c70a8512dc1e74d40b63f833ca4a58ae4da", "ja": "ですが、今日のところは遠慮いたします。\n申し訳ありません。", "zh": "不过……今天还是先不用了。实在抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5318a6e9207ef199dd43de2ea2b8df1c399ce44b59d20219dacd6f8f76a15def", "ja": "えっ……あっ、もしかしてお仕事？", "zh": "诶……啊，难道是有工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "6d1cdd0f82c7f76df5444ac6a94df77c4330af045c22925450fa9f30704ecf57", "ja": "いえ、そういうわけでは。ただ……\n今宵はもう少し台本を読み込んでおきたいのです。", "zh": "不，并非如此。只是……\n今晚我还想多研读一下剧本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b84a52437eaafa436e05d111b2ed3899ce27b5173013980819aaa000de221473", "ja": "そっか……そうだよね、まだ初日だし。\nごめんね、急に誘ったりして。", "zh": "这样啊……也是，毕竟今天才是第一天。\n不好意思，突然邀请你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "f2d3b7a2467a07b390242bf557a32131cc98b75c386101e1c05cc52d72d5ad11", "ja": "いえ、こちらこそ。\nそれでは……、お先に失礼いたします。", "zh": "不，是我这边才是。\n那么……我就先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "06613f9076956de71027107d225b0ff2f13743ae44909a8e9d55efbd2f2b2b3c", "ja": "ということが、昨日あったんです。\nやっぱり飲み会なのがいけなかったんでしょうか……？", "zh": "昨天发生了这样的事。\n果然，问题还是出在那次聚餐上吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bf19b8562cb66c5b518767c4f4041427986d21273db50d2bd008fa8e44e8dc73", "ja": "うう、きっとそうですよね。貴音ちゃん未成年だし。\n大人っぽいから、つい勘違いしちゃうけど……はぁ。", "zh": "呜呜，一定是这样的吧。贵音还是未成年呢。\n虽然她看起来很成熟，总让我不小心误会……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "15e37ce661863e28f8ff19568c7532615f0e74d2f4c7595c60f034531997e0b4", "ja": "なるほど。つまり風花は、\n貴音に来てもらいたかったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，风花是想让贵音过来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ec8dfc44e657c79e14e85f9c57c349e2d7ed7d5f201eca89735b1ee30addeea3", "ja": "はい……。今回のお仕事で、\n改めて貴音ちゃんと仲良くなりたいって思って。", "zh": "是的……通过这次工作，我又想和贵音酱重新好好相处了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b20878df98ddbfc5481a041360c06c0a0e54a21a6fe60178551340aac2268fe5", "ja": "もちろん、今も仲良くしてくれてるんですけど、\nどこか線を引かれてるような気もしていて……。", "zh": "当然，她现在也跟我挺要好的，\n但我总觉得……中间仿佛还是隔着一道距离……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "61b30c8d0ea63e8f546db267d6424c2935a860b74f6cccf8c5fb6139fa50eef2", "ja": "でもよく考えたら、だからってグイグイ来られても\n迷惑ですよね？　嫌われちゃいますよね？", "zh": "不过仔细想想，话虽如此，要是对方一个劲儿地凑过来，也会让人困扰吧？会被讨厌的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "37c5376ffeabde8eea4457689cfa3c7076402f0d63ac8de9fe773a7ea58197ee", "ja": "いや、そんなことないよ。風花なら大丈夫。\nそのあたり、ちゃんと間違えないだろうから。", "zh": "不，不是那样。风花的话没问题。\n她不会在这方面犯错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "747dfe7dc2fdc51ca7a7a5bba151faaf1c93f9db4766a51301c60d7f4dc08f83", "ja": "えっ……、そ、そうですか？\nそれなら、いいんですけど……。", "zh": "咦……是、是这样吗？\n那样的话，就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "df1bf016b34be0563d6d0d10c19fe94891ed88517d8757403a8c35e0d07133c7", "ja": "ただ貴音は、自分のことをあまり話さないんだ。\n知っての通り、かなり浮世離れしてるところもある。", "zh": "不过贵音不太会谈自己的事。\n你也知道，她有些地方相当脱离尘世。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d7c52ed7d26213b9ab314ef197cdf2be1f592068f56becabafefdafe7a8a3a7e", "ja": "そのあたりを気にしている部分はあるかな。\nいろいろ事情があるらしい。ただ……。", "zh": "她或许也会在意这些方面吧。\n听说其中似乎有各种缘由。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b07fd51fb87341111679f476cf179e10a75892a2d23bb66ac6aec48930951fcb", "ja": "貴音は貴音なんだけどな。", "zh": "贵音就是贵音啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aaaa26b8911ca78898db227a41efe769c269e4414c1e255de3bcc4419276a467", "ja": "……そうですよね。人はそれぞれ、大変な事情を抱えて\nいて。貴音ちゃんも、そうなのかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "……是啊。每个人都有各自不容易的情况。贵音也可能是这样，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1028_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e8e9c17e9c11dac7629ff444088e0ad7eaaccb1f50f9b6bb6cf17075353f4640", "ja": "でも、貴音ちゃんは貴音ちゃんで。\n……そういうもの、ですよね？", "zh": "但是，贵音就是贵音。\n……就是这么回事，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "428eb87fd29bf19fce6b43ae5b11b6ce3f8fe3959c9889b80827a30695613875", "ja": "うん。それはそれ、貴音は貴音。\nそういうものだと思う。", "zh": "嗯。那是那回事，贵音就是贵音。\n我觉得就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "c4b5e0390dd9a9769946f1e991ea88359a0917ee2f06076f5c5d84a8bc46f37b", "ja": "（ただ……貴音本人は、\nそうは思ってないのかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（只是……贵音本人或许并不这么想吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "1b20a10161884072bf88fe43167c1599f8421e3d0d7ed78fae21aa5a5eb6baa6", "ja": "（2日目の撮影が始まった。昼間は、風花は釈然と\nしていなかったけど、大丈夫だろうか……）", "zh": "（第2天的拍摄开始了。白天风花还是一副无法释怀的样子，不知道没问题吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ebb12dfbe3df451377ad0696755ceda9ec3986442c7ccb9d807c94c64d9761e6", "ja": "「話しててわかるよ。\n夕貴乃は、和臣さんが大切なんだって」", "zh": "「听你说话我就能明白。\n夕贵乃其实很在乎和臣先生」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a09afb1f0f78c1b1c299b3201c26cda0cee0cc8934c811f6590a0cb346708ad9", "ja": "「だから、これ以上自分を傷つけないで」", "zh": "「所以，不要再继续伤害自己了」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_02_1034_008tak", "source_sha256": "2086a7f17f5d03cc5ce9e43d6eaf08917064bdba84fd0f04210806e1e07e8a91", "ja": "「……そう言う帆風はどうなの？」", "zh": "「……那这么说的帆风你呢？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
